<title>SINGAPORE: Toll road deal spurs Van Der Horst shares.</title>
<headline>Toll road deal spurs Van Der Horst shares.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Power and engineering company Van Der Horst rose over eight percent late on Wednesday afternoon as investors anticipated more deals after a toll road project was confirmed on Monday.</p>
<p>At 0828 GMT, the stock was up Singapore $0.45 to S$5.85 on 735,000 shares.</p>
